# SHA-256 digest of the release signing certificate (public information, the same value as `keytool -list -v` "SHA256:" without
# colons). The Release workflow accepts a signed APK only when apksigner reports exactly this certificate
# (scripts/release/check-signing-cert.sh).
#
# KEY ROTATION is a deliberate edit of this file, in a pull request the owner approves: replace the line below with the new
# certificate's digest and describe why in the pull request (docs/release.md, section "Rotate the signing key").
# Android refuses updates signed with a different key, so rotating also needs a plan for existing installs.
